{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "活跃时长(2026-09-24):今天有动静的分钟数(多个会话同时开着不重复算);柱 = 近 7 天每天的活跃时长,今天用源色;底行 = 近 7 天有用量日子的日均,变化对比前 7 天的总时长。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "活跃时长",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "h": " 小时 ",
        "m": " 分",
        "sub": "今天",
        "avg": "近 7 天日均 ",
        "hr": " 小时 "
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Active",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "h": "h ",
        "m": "m",
        "sub": "Today",
        "avg": "7-day avg ",
        "hr": "h "
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "活跃时长(2026-09-24):今天有动静的分钟数(多个会话同时开着不重复算);柱 = 近 7 天每天的活跃时长,今天用源色;底行 = 近 7 天有用量日子的日均,变化对比前 7 天的总时长。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-92pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.active.m}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "$[if::(gt::(${w.active.h},0),${w.active.h}${@i18n.h},)]${w.active.m}${@i18n.m}",
            "fontSize": "22pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.active.m}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+6.6pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "22pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+27pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.sub}",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}-32pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "1pt",
        "bgColor": "#EFE5E1|#2A2522"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "forEach",
        "props": {
          "items": "${w.active.bars}",
          "key": "_it",
          "index": "_i"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "12pt+${_it.i}*({parent.w}-24pt)/7",
            "y": "{parent.h}-62pt+30pt*${_it.u}",
            "w": "({parent.w}-24pt)/7-5pt",
            "h": "30pt*${_it.v}",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "1.5pt",
              "rightT": "1.5pt",
              "leftB": "0pt",
              "rightB": "0pt"
            },
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(${_it.t},1),#C15F3C|#E8916B,#E9D5CD|#3B302B)]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.active.avg}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.avg}${w.active.avg}${@i18n.hr}${w.active.c}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.active.avg}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.avg}--",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚:右上角、与卡名同一基线、9pt、右对齐(卡片设计系统 §3)。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      }
    ]
  }
}